  "dependency": "DUB17 Theorem 2.6 / DUB18 Corollary 8.2 -> literal higher symmetric-power continuation -> arithmetic automorphy -> original all-weight characteristic-zero association -> original Gamma1 Picard/H1 -> Abel-Jacobi principal-divisor converse -> analytic reciprocity -> actual winding integral.",
